" - " &amp; Code.HTMLDecode(Fields!FTR_SUB_ACCOUNT_TEXT.Value),"")&amp; IIF(len(Fields!FTR_NARRATION.Value) &gt;0, vbcrlf &amp; Code.HTMLDecode(Fields!FTR_NARRATION.Value),"")
'=Code.HTMLDecode(Fields!FTR_ACCOUNT_NAME.Value) &amp; IIF(len(Fields!FTR_NARRATION.Value) &gt;0, vbcrlf &amp; Code.HTMLDecode(Fields!FTR_NARRATION.Value),"")</Value>
